<node id="claim_con_tailors_co_electronics">
  <data key="d28">MechanismClaim</data>
  <data key="d29">In situ CoN incorporation energetically tailors the Co d-orbital electronic structure in the c-CoSe2/CoN heterostructure and lowers thermodynamic barriers for ORR/OER.</data>
  <data key="d38">electronic-structure mechanism</data>
  <data key="d39">In situ CoN incorporation energetically tailors the Co d-orbital electronic structure in the c-CoSe2/CoN heterostructure and lowers thermodynamic barriers for ORR/OER.</data>
  <data key="d40">computational</data>
  <data key="d30">This is the authors' theoretical interpretation of the effect of heterointerface engineering on bifunctional oxygen electrocatalysis.</data>
  <data key="d31">["claim_con_tailors_co_electronics"]</data>
  <data key="d32">1</data>
  <data key="d33">broad_mechanism_abstract</data>
  <data key="d34">broad_abstract_support</data>
  <data key="d35">True</data>
  <data key="d36">abstract</data>
  <data key="d37">type: MechanismClaim
